# Formalism: ordered conditional parametric 3-D L-system with terminal homomorphism
# Parse    : pass; validator=corpus-static
# Execute  : not-run; target=attached-cpu
# Render   : unsupported; reason=unsupported render profile 'turtle3d-propfeds'
# Fidelity : projection
# Features : conditional, ordered, parametric, terminal-homomorphism, turtle3d
# Angle    : 15
